      "releaseNotes": "New\n\n- AI: Added Raycast AI Credits and the new Max plan, with clear monthly allowances for Pro, Pro+, and Max\n\nImprovements\n\n- AI: Added credit balances, usage details, and relative cost indicators in the model picker\n- AI: Using your own AI provider API keys now requires a Raycast Pro plan.\n- AI: Models are now grouped more consistently by provider, including models from Vercel AI Gateway\n- AI: Improved chat reliability when tools fail and while preparing longer conversations\n- Snippets: Expansions now work after symbols and immediately after another expansion\n- Home: Tap the selected tab again to quickly scroll back to the top\n- Dictation: Improved reliability when the active audio device changes\n\nFixes\n\n- AI: Failed attachments now show clear recovery actions and can be removed\n- AI: Fixed crashes and layout issues affecting source links\n- AI: Fixed Quick AI model selection not refreshing after changes\n- AI: Fixed an issue where prompts from desktop automation runs appeared blank on iOS\n- Notes: Fixed Markdown appearing in titles of notes created by AI\n- Subscriptions: Fixed the previous account’s plan briefly appearing after signing in with a different account.",
